    %% Flows between layers
    L1 ==>|"public APIs only"| L2
    L2 ==>|"graded, scoped chunks"| L3
    L3 ==>|"hybrid search"| L4
    L4 <==>|"entities in · verified tool cards out"| L5
    L3 ==>|"versioned rules"| L5
    L4 ==>|"cited answer · grounding report"| L6

